    "“%@” 在你打开后被外部修改过，保存会覆盖新内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” was modified externally after you opened it. Saving will overwrite new changes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” 在你打开后被外部修改过，保存会覆盖新内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” 有未保存的修改，从磁盘重新载入会丢弃它们。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” has unsaved changes. Reloading from disk will discard them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” 有未保存的修改，从磁盘重新载入会丢弃它们。"
