    "开启后，Agent 读写文件或执行命令时不再弹出确认，由客户端代为批准。关闭则每次工具调用都需你确认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, file read/write and command executions are approved by the client without confirmation prompts. When disabled, each tool call requires your confirmation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，Agent 读写文件或执行命令时不再弹出确认，由客户端代为批准。关闭则每次工具调用都需你确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，Agent 读写文件或执行命令时不再弹窗确认。部分 Agent 会把这项带到自己的会话里；其它选项可在会话信息中调整。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, file read/write and command execution will not prompt for confirmation. Some Agents carry this setting into their sessions; other options can be adjusted in Session Info."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，Agent 读写文件或执行命令时不再弹窗确认。部分 Agent 会把这项带到自己的会话里；其它选项可在会话信息中调整。"
